Ametller MCP is an independent project, not affiliated with Ametller Origen.

The protocol investigation used Ametller's publicly served storefront and
Salesforce Commerce API documentation, with these MIT-licensed projects as
implementation references:

https://github.com/igorsafonov-gif/ametller-origen
https://github.com/denya/ametller-origen-skill
https://github.com/andreu-alegre/ametller-cli

Original reference checkouts and website bundles are local research material,
excluded from the release crate and plugin. Their original licenses and rights
remain in effect; this project's MIT license does not relicense retailer assets,
product descriptions or product images. Anonymous product data used by contract
tests is included only as a small interoperability fixture.
